@bank all
// CR1 (lead 49, the 0.99.7 playtest patch, notes 49, 55 and 56; plans/patch-0997.md): the first promotion's test on
// Monday, Day 8, the same afternoon as Making it safe; the Training tab's checklist ticks only what has happened; the
// training job named on the board. Calder speaks unless noted: exact, numbers not adjectives, never "well done" and no
// "!". Mails are "Subject | body", unsigned (the game adds the sender). Used only with the switch CR_DAY8_ON (24p's slot).

// Calder, the moment Making it safe is done and you're Reliable: the test is this afternoon ({time})
== cr.ready
- That's Making it safe: all of it done. Your Tier 2 test is today, {time}, at the board.
== cr.ready.mail
- Your Tier 2 test: today | Today at {time}, the Works job board. Pass to make Officer.
// the device's urgent notice
== cr.ready.notice
- Your Tier 2 test: today, {time}, the job board in the Works bay.

// the Works app's Training tab, "Your promotion" checklist ({day}: the first day a test can be; {time}: its hour)
== cr.promo.check.from
- The test from Day {day}
== cr.promo.check.reached
- Reached
== cr.promo.check.set
- Test job: {day}, {time}
== cr.promo.check.today
- today
== cr.promo.check.tomorrow
- tomorrow

// the job board: the row of your training job (only that one, never later jobs of its kind), "Your ...: take this one"
== cr.board.m6
- Make it safe training job

// the job board (note 25, BOARD_NEW_ON): a round of a kind you learned lately, posted before the afternoon ({deck})
== cr.round.title
- Extra round, Deck {deck}
